msgid ""
"With Master Fire Magic you can learn all of the Master spells for this element.  Higher level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.  Master Fire Magic can be yours if you have an Expert skill level of 7 in Fire Magic and can pay the price of 4000 gold."
msgstr ""
